 labeled “Discount Coupon”, “Discount Code” Promotional ”, etc. In some stores you will need to be logged in to be able to view this field. </p>","text_color":"#54595F","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.5,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"325b91df","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"animation":"stuckMoveUpOpacity","animation_duration":"fast","animation_delay":500},"elements":[{"id":"681849b2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h4>Discount Link</h4><p>In this case a code will not be required - the discount will be automatically applied to the products of the site, that is, the prices of the products will already appear with lower values. Stores may have 2 different behaviors: (A) some will show discounts on the value of products in the listing (may show “from / by” or show only the reduced price.</p>","text_color":"#54595F","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.5,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"8b40d06","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"animation":"stuckMoveUpOpacity","animation_duration":"fast","animation_delay":800},"elements":[{"id":"2532859e","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h4>Offers</h4><p>Redeal we also list the best deals that stores advertise every day. In such cases, our coupon will not always reduce prices further (which are already well reduced because of these discount actions).</p>","text_color":"#54595F","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.5,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"550c8e4e","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Divider","color":"rgba(122, 122, 122, 0.17)","gap":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"divider"},{"id":"584fb667","elType":"widget","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"fal fa-users","library":"fa-light"},"title_text":"About Redeal Site","description_text":"","position":"left","title_size":"div","primary_color":"#23A455","icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":33,"sizes":[]},"content_vertical_alignment":"middle","title_color":"#23A455","title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"_animation":"stuckFlipUpOpacity"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon-box"},{"id":"a8fd2ae","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Read is a completely free site that offers discounts through coupons and offers from leading national and international online stores. Every time you make a purchase over the internet, we help you save money. As well? We deal with the best e-commerce companies and search the internet to find and offer exclusive coupons and special discounts at your favorite online stores.</p>","text_color":"#54595F","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.5,"sizes":[]},"_animation":"stuckMoveUpOpacity","animation_duration":"fast","_animation_delay":200},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false}]

